  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">R&#xe4;dda Barnen Sverige EU-Jerusalem 2013-2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save the Children Sweden EU-Jerusalem 2013-2016 - Save the Children Sweden EU-Jerusalem</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja en h&#xe4;lsosam utveckling och konstruktiv livsstil bland ungdomar i &#xf6;stra Jerusalem. Projektm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra kvaliteten p&#xe5; den h&#xe4;lsov&#xe5;rd som erbjuds palestinska  ungdomar och deras familjer i &#xf6;stra Jerusalem, s&#xe5; att de kan uppfylla sin potential och leva drogfritt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to promote healthy development and constructive lifestyle for youth in East Jerusalem. The specific objective is to improve the quality of services provided to Palestinian youth and their families in East Jerusalem to develop  their full potential and lead drug free lives.</narrative>
  </description>
